    {
      "thread_id": 1452584885096284160,
      "thread_name": "Buildings Guide",
      "message_count": 47,
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": 1452584885096284160,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "In <Last Asylum: Survival>, there are a variety of buildings, each with unique features.\nAlmost all buildings can be upgraded to a higher level by clicking the green arrow.Upgrading buildings boosts your strength and unlocks additional bonuses.\nThe level of each building is always capped at the current level of the Sanctuary. Building upgrades require strategic planning around the Sanctuary level. Prioritize upgrading the Sanctuary, use Builder's Hut to reduce construction time, and gradually enhance Research, Barracks, Training Grounds, and Infirmary based on your needs. This balanced approach ensures might and resource growth, preventing issues like restricted troop training or stagnant progress.Below is a breakdown of the core functions of key buildings.\n\n**Sanctuary**\nThe Sanctuary is the most vital building, as it dictates the max level of all other structures.\nAfter upgrading the Sanctuary, the following stats will increase:\n•Might\n•Hero Level Cap\n•Hero HP\n•Hero ATK\n•Hero DEF\n•Building Level Cap\nAdditionally, upgrading the Sanctuary will also:\n•Grant EXP rewards (EXP gain shown in upgrade image);\n•Unlock new buildings.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:53:44.329000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452584885096284160/1452584885347815424/image.png?ex=6a993598&is=6a97e418&hm=2370fe68bf9ca40f080e0c84393ca8b4922598fac37a75d207b2059ba8d43652&"
            },
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452584885096284160/1452584885712584829/image.png?ex=6a993598&is=6a97e418&hm=c430fe0dc04fbf93f6722cb20367c5b9e379eb55822d1addcbcf34586ba646ca&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452584987378454623,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "Builder's Hut\n\nIn the early game, when your base is below Lv.15, the Builder's Hut will be your most valuable asset.\nThis building grants you free construction speedups.By keeping the Builder's Hut at the same level as the Sanctuary, you can rapidly upgrade numerous other structures.\nHere, you can see which survivors are working in this building.You can also replace existing Survivors with others who offer higher bonus effects.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:54:08.715000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452584885096284160/1452584986971734122/image.png?ex=6a9935b0&is=6a97e430&hm=f8a242c5ee48bb2eea704c816e1853483ca804cee15380c6b4342fabfc610b67&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452585036674105577,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "Research Lab\n\nScientific research is essential for boosting your might. In the Research Lab, you can study various technologies to gain a wide range of buffs and bonuses.\nBoth might cultivation and economic development can receive significant numerical boosts through tech research.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:54:20.468000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452584885096284160/1452585036422320258/image.png?ex=6a9935bc&is=6a97e43c&hm=de5dc31fb59c144a1f9da7c952cbf84454340b99b6ec71f59731589fb94c190d&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452585159961481287,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "Barracks & Training Grounds\n    \nThese two buildings often cause confusion due to their similar themes, but their functions are distinct:\nBarracks are for upgrading troop types; Training Grounds are for expanding troop type capacity.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:54:49.862000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452584885096284160/1452585159177142303/image.png?ex=6a9935d9&is=6a97e459&hm=82c72da0a73ffd8229663e1c798429f0fc4a5b9e43f145ac571a9e9063e5beac&"
            },
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452584885096284160/1452585159483199568/image.png?ex=6a9935d9&is=6a97e459&hm=fedb251622406df3a5dde110e293385bb1314bb7969f2c45e5f6d87a1d869def&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452585207055257652,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "Infirmary\n\nWhen you suffer a defeat in battle, some of your soldiers won't be killed outright; instead, they'll be critically injured and sent to the Infirmary.This is the Infirmary's core function: healing wounded troops.\nHow it works:\nTroops injured in battle are sent to the Infirmary.\nYou need to consume certain resources (such as Gold, Medicine, or time) to heal these troops.\nOnce healing is complete, troops will recover to full health and rejoin your army for future battles.\n\nMany more buildings await your exploration in the game. Master the rhythm of building upgrades and lay a solid foundation for your base. This way, you'll be able to face challenges in the post-apocalyptic world of Last Asylum: Survival with greater confidence and continuously grow your power!",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:55:01.090000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452584885096284160/1452585207025762304/image.png?ex=6a9935e5&is=6a97e465&hm=d6716ace35b22f1ae8daa6d0747061d1f0e623dcd93ca1d76548334553f1322a&"
            }
          ]
        },
