        {
          "id": 1452585657166856325,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "Doctors, the shadow of the plague is gradually enveloping the entire city.To advance your development more efficiently and accelerate the fight against the epidemic, joining an alliance and fighting alongside fellow doctors is an excellent strategic choice.\nAn alliance is like a warm yet powerful family—\nHere, you can fight side by side, support one another, share resources, grow and strengthen together, and unlock a wealth of exciting events.\n\n**What You Gain by Joining an Alliance**\nAfter joining an alliance, you will be able to:\n•Collaborate with alliance members to complete a variety of quests;\n•Join forces in battles and face enemies as a united front;\n•Assist each other to speed up construction and hero cultivation progress;\n•Share resources and vital intelligence;\n•Chat in the alliance channel and meet like-minded allies.\nThrough alliance cooperation, your overall development speed and might growth will receive a massive boost.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:56:48.405000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "alliance_guide.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452585657166856325/1452585657334632489/alliance_guide.png?ex=6a993650&is=6a97e4d0&hm=b6836c9e8d330271299839cd43a926a84b3b86414f470603d5a6e8187f17496a&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452585754952859698,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "# How to Join Alliance\n**1. Find Alliance**\nThe Alliance feature will be officially unlocked once your Sanctuary reaches Level 5.\nFollow these steps to find an alliance:\n1.Tap the [Alliance] button in the bottom-right corner of the main game screen;\n2.Once in the Alliance interface, view the list of alliances recommended by the system.\n￮Recommendations are usually based on activity level, rankings, or proximity.\n3.Alternatively, use the search function to enter an alliance name or ID and locate a specific alliance.\n\n**II. Submit an Application**\nAfter selecting your desired alliance, tap [Apply to Join]:\n•Open Alliances: You'll be admitted immediately after submitting your application.\n•Approval-Required Alliances: You'll need to wait for review and approval from the alliance admins.\nOnce your application is approved, the system will send you a notification confirming your successful alliance membership.\nYou can then participate in alliance events, donate resources, and interact with your fellow members.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:57:11.719000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1452586117399314452,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "# How to Choose the Right Alliance\n\nPicking an alliance that suits your playstyle will drastically elevate your gaming experience:\n🔹 Alliance Activity\n•Prioritize alliances with highly active members;\n\n•Active alliances complete quests faster and offer more generous rewards;\n•Keep an eye on member online status and chat frequency to gauge activity.\n🔹 Alliance Level & Rankings\n\n•High-level, top-ranked alliances typically offer stronger tech buffs and larger resource reserves;\n•Note that these alliances may impose requirements on member might or activity levels.\n🔹 Alliance Goals & Playstyle\n•Casual Players: Opt for laid-back, friendly alliances with no strict requirements;\n•Competitive Players: Choose alliances that prioritize wars and rankings as their core goals.\n🔹 Language & Communication\n\n•Join an alliance where members speak a common language; this will greatly facilitate coordination and quest collaboration",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:58:38.133000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1452586330604179507,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "# Overview of Core Alliance Gameplay\n\n**I. Alliance Technology**\n•Earn Alliance EXP by assisting fellow members or making daily tech donations.\n•Upgrading Alliance Technology levels grants powerful permanent buffs to all alliance members.\n\n**II. Alliance Shop**\n•Stock refreshes every Monday\n•Exchange Alliance EXP for a variety of valuable items:\n￮Recruit Ticket;\n￮Construction Speedups;\n￮Other critical development resources.\n\nThis is a key way to boost your base construction and overall might growth.\n\n**3. Alliance Gifts**\n•Alliance members earn Alliance Gifts by completing designated quests.\n\n•Claiming gifts increases your Gift Level.\n\n•Higher Gift Levels unlock richer rewards and additional alliance features.\n\n**4. Alliance Help**\n•Members can assist each other to reduce quest and construction time.\n\n•This speeds up base development and hero training, drastically improving your overall efficiency.\n\nDoctors, join an alliance today!\nTeam up with your allies to explore more events, dispel the shadow of the plague together,\nand build your ideal home step by step!🌱",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T08:59:28.965000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452585657166856325/1452586330562363402/image.png?ex=6a9936f0&is=6a97e570&hm=b187d39d3602a8f12ff90b4637827157f1730131eedf37c830dd045e1e1368cc&"
            }
          ]
        },
