          "id": 1470901802772725801,
          "author_id": 129677574031802369,
          "author_name": "_akuta",
          "content": "This actually doesn't work (it will remove the checkmark next to it in the pop up, but it does not remove the marker and in fact sends an alliance message that you've created a new marker). You have to click the magnifying glass, then go up to the top near where the coordinates are and click the star, then go to the alliance tab, then click the trash can next to the marker you want to remove. I learned this through a lot of trial and error, searching for the comparison in Last War posts, then realizing that instead of the individual icons for the markers that it was just the star and tapped it on a guess.",
