        {
          "id": 1496191769447104512,
          "author_id": 1435341545422454925,
          "author_name": "vickystrumpher",
          "content": "At what point can you manually start changing ranks? And adding players to R4",
          "created_at": "2026-04-21T16:51:55.735000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1496207400901021796,
          "author_id": 881944495409754112,
          "author_name": "supermodelba",
          "content": "It's your kill points to increase it you need to attack others cities and kill troops. A good way without causing drama is to attack those without an alliance",
          "created_at": "2026-04-21T17:54:02.564000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1496208308502007808,
          "author_id": 881944495409754112,
          "author_name": "supermodelba",
          "content": "That depends on the alliance leader, if you are the leader, for r4 you want to choose people who will help you lead while you are offline or even online. Those who boost the fun and support of other team members. The other ranks depend if you want to rate each person by their might. Usually I keep most inactive in r1, so when I get more people to join I know who to kick.",
          "created_at": "2026-04-21T17:57:38.953000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1496208563570479385,
          "author_id": 1435341545422454925,
          "author_name": "vickystrumpher",
          "content": "Thank you. But how do we manually change ranks, because mine is on an automatic thing",
          "created_at": "2026-04-21T17:58:39.766000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1496208909176930526,
          "author_id": 881944495409754112,
          "author_name": "supermodelba",
          "content": "The alliance announcement will be the little speaker phone icon in the top right corner. If gives you a choice to make a vote or an announcement notice",
          "created_at": "2026-04-21T18:00:02.165000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1496209260663804024,
          "author_id": 881944495409754112,
          "author_name": "supermodelba",
          "content": "You go to the alliance member page and click on the person you want to move. Change rank. To turn off automatically you need to go to the setting in the alliance page",
