          "content": "that is a rule likely set up by the lead teams. We have NAP a non aggression pact on 2 of my servers.  the top 20 alliances do not attack each other so they can stay strong for SvS and KvK battles. However any alliance in 21 and lower are fare game. I feel in general most players attack non alliance tagged players for resources or to get kills. Usually players with default names, no alliance and often level 10 or less.  But there are no \"official\" rules from the developers against alliances waging war on each other. You are in fact correct that it is mechanic of the game.",
