    {
      "thread_id": 1452586519821947001,
      "thread_name": "Hero Upgrade: How To Get Antitoxin",
      "message_count": 10,
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": 1452586519821947001,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "Antitoxin is a crucial resource for character progression and overall might growth. It can be primarily obtained through three methods: daily gameplay, event rewards, and pack purchases.\n\n**I. Daily Gameplay**\n1. Antitoxin Workshop & Stable Production\n•Antitoxin Workshop produces antitoxins at regular intervals.\n•The higher the level of the Antitoxin Workshop, the more antitoxins you'll get per unit time.\n•Antitoxins can be collected via the Stable, making it one of the stable sources of antitoxins.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:00:14.078000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "hero_upgrade.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452586519821947001/1452586520090251407/hero_upgrade.png?ex=6a99371e&is=6a97e59e&hm=f12e999b72d2d2d8363edc369fe0e703f38445602fc76050012e5541176afab6&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452586662751113236,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**2. Building Upgrade Rewards**\n•All buildings in your base will grant a certain amount of Antitoxins upon completion of an upgrade.\n•As the building level increases, the amount of Antitoxins obtained will gradually rise.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:00:48.155000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452586519821947001/1452586662403248128/image.png?ex=6a993740&is=6a97e5c0&hm=263d461c1483b30681ff1f1e0d24dd14e040a6c72df737af66c1ff3ea04a8638&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452586763758469262,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**3. Falcon Quest**\n    \n•Completing Falcon Quests rewards you with Antitoxins.\n\n•The amount of Antitoxins varies depending on the level of the Falcon Quest.\n•Most Falcon Quests include Antitoxin rewards, so we recommend prioritizing their completion.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:01:12.237000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452586519821947001/1452586763418865797/image.png?ex=6a993758&is=6a97e5d8&hm=80ead8b0af91143177c4e5aa96f5abb40b7b2cff774f3863b3518bc59ffb1bda&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452586833803214881,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "** 4. Covert Ops Force & Caravan Trade**\n•Both completing Covert Ops Force Quests and Caravan Trade will earn you Antitoxins.\n•You can get antitoxins whether you complete your own quests or plunder others'.\n\n•Each player can plunder others' Covert Operation up to 5 times per day.\n•The amount of Antitoxins obtained from Covert Operation varies by color, with Golden Covert Operations offering the highest rewards.\n\n**5. Blight & Elite Blight**\n•Spend 10 Stamina to hunt Blight.\n￮Defeating Blight of different levels yields abundant Antitoxins.\n•Spend 20 Stamina to challenge Elite Blight.\n￮Defeating Elite Blight of different levels earns you abundant Antitoxins.\nThis is a cost-effective way to consume Stamina and acquire Antitoxins.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:01:28.937000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587308086722663,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**II. Event Rewards**\nParticipating in in-game events allows you to earn generous rewards. Take the Cheese Trap Event as an example.\n\n•Join Cheese Trap-related events.\n•Earn Event Points based on your individual kill count and your alliance's total kill count.\n•Different Point tiers correspond to different amounts of antitoxin rewards, with overall rewards being very generous\n\n**III. Pack Purchase**\n•You can obtain Antitoxins directly by purchasing packs.\n\n•This option is suitable for players who want to quickly level up and shorten their growth cycle.\n\n**Summary**\nThe best way to acquire Antitoxins and accelerate growth is to arrange your daily gameplay strategically, actively participate in events, and choose packs to supplement based on your own situation.\nBy consistently engaging in high-reward gameplay, your Antitoxin accumulation will be quite substantial.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:03:22.015000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1466445402067959910,
          "author_id": 1464850135380005047,
          "author_name": "overall0757",
          "content": "❤️",
          "created_at": "2026-01-29T14:50:29.091000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1491196103855575090,
          "author_id": 1369939812613750784,
          "author_name": "dorna0642",
          "content": "",
          "created_at": "2026-04-07T22:00:56.243000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image0.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452586519821947001/1491196103561842800/image0.png?ex=6a994558&is=6a97f3d8&hm=8a2771e9c05fc635069d5f7876e69cba944d07b9766a46097b02751004002a52&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1492097676253331569,
          "author_id": 1491991455676498104,
          "author_name": "nicole_pad",
