        {
          "id": 1528115423302652026,
          "author_id": 754131916164300892,
          "author_name": "keres1286",
          "content": "The in-game token exchange shops are a scam; they don't deliver the items even after deducting the tokens, and support is doing nothing about it. I'm on server 40, and this has happened to me personally on two occasions with different items, as well as to other players. However, support or customer service doesn't respond; they leave this bot that doesn't resolve anything, and they are stealing from us. If the game is in 'pay-to-win' mode, then at least be honest and take off the mask. These dynamics are becoming increasingly dirty, which is why many servers are dying",
          "created_at": "2026-07-18T19:05:07.927000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "thread_id": 1452587435383980144,
      "thread_name": "Ultimate Hero Squad Cultivation Guide",
      "message_count": 44,
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": 1452587435383980144,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "To gain an advantage on the battlefield, team composition and cultivation strategy are crucial. Overall, building a powerful squad can be approached from three core aspects: lineup, positioning, and unit type.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:03:52.365000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "hero_squad.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452587435383980144/1452587436097015993/hero_squad.png?ex=6a9937f8&is=6a97e678&hm=416b21fa8426e1e87e7dabed7a60aba51b99e0e5d4f219b60936afcde942537e&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587501263912961,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**I. Lineup Development Priority: Plan First, Then Invest**\n\n\nBefore cultivating heroes, you first need to clarify the development direction of your main lineup. Different unit types have varying formation rhythms. Choosing a direction in advance avoids resource waste.\nWe recommend focusing on developing a single main lineup for the long term, concentrating resources on leveling up and equipping these heroes. This growth efficiency is significantly higher than developing multiple lineups simultaneously.\nRecommended Early-Stage Hero Lineup:\nFrontline: Arthur, Bella\nBackline: Marlena, Claire, Celia",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:04:08.072000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452587435383980144/1452587501108596736/image.png?ex=6a993808&is=6a97e688&hm=162f6d2e0632b75a9a46b62ff9ffacf2245400ce2fb7ac33860e4ca866023cfe&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587551335518352,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "During the cultivation process, prioritize enhancing core damage dealer characters. For example, the gear of main attack units should be upgraded first. In the early stage, we highly recommend focusing on cultivating the UR Hero Marlena.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:04:20.010000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452587435383980144/1452587551125667951/image.png?ex=6a993813&is=6a97e693&hm=fa583d81c271cebbf01c65a0e91a7a651582709aeacb5b7d03bf32361b4a19f2&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587589633576991,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "Additionally, heroes experience a significant power boost after reaching 4 stars. This should be set as a key phased goal.\n\n**II. Unit Type: Counter & Lineup Bonuses\n**\nEffectively utilizing unit type features is a crucial way to widen the might gap with opponents.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:04:29.141000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587687424032789,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**Unit Counter**",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:04:52.456000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452587435383980144/1452587687096881206/image.png?ex=6a993834&is=6a97e6b4&hm=5a459daf6aef83632be98ef1551507ce4c70bf48e4b17b3b2df01e989bb71d2f&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587722530357268,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "The three unit types form a counter cycle:\nWarrior＞Ranger＞Warlock＞Warrior\nIn battles, selecting unit types that counter the enemy's lineup can often help you defeat stronger opponents.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:05:00.826000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452587435383980144/1452587722299674624/image.png?ex=6a99383c&is=6a97e6bc&hm=de449a4c47002841a7b7880f1dbf7a3d34076c9294e340cb0210cef26fe6eae5&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587793296396350,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**Same-Unit Type Lineup Bonuses**\n\nUsing heroes of the same unit type in your team triggers additional attribute boosts (HP, ATK, DEF). The more same-type heroes you have, the higher the bonus:\n•3 same-type heroes: 5% attribute increase\n•4 same-type heroes: 15% attribute increase\n•5 same-type heroes: 20% attribute increase\nThis makes building a same-unit type lineup an excellent choice for your main team, as it delivers substantial overall benefits.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:05:17.698000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587914428022924,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**III. Positioning: Secure a Stable Attack Environment**\nIn battles, reasonable positioning maximizes the value of each hero. The basic positioning principle is:",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:05:46.578000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452587435383980144/1452587914142683287/image.png?ex=6a99386a&is=6a97e6ea&hm=9ffd02c8a3797ac24f90de28a2c5ebe0d20395f38cccf3d8fcf518996fab6b8d&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587939757559922,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:05:52.617000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452587435383980144/1452587939694379059/image.png?ex=6a993870&is=6a97e6f0&hm=6284d7dc6369858420bda253a737af9cfc2ec15765cc49c86b0eee0848bd3edd&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452587986108813353,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "•Frontline: Assigned to defensive heroes. Their role is to absorb enemy damage and protect backline units.\n•Backline: Place attack and support units here to provide sustained damage output and support effects.\nA stable frontline is the foundation for the backline to exert its full potential. Only with proper positioning can you maintain a favorable battle rhythm.\n\n**Summary**\nClarify your lineup direction, skillfully use unit countering, arrange positions reasonably, and concentrate resources on cultivating core heroes.\nMay all Doctors find the lineup that suits them best,\nachieve continuous victories on the battlefield, and fully enjoy the thrill of combat!🎯",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:06:03.668000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1465305515830546476,
