    {
      "thread_id": 1452588183970644079,
      "thread_name": "Hero Cultivation Guide",
      "message_count": 29,
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": 1452588183970644079,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "In <Last Asylum: Survival>, the overall Might of your heroes determines your progress speed and combat efficiency. A formidable hero team will help you build your ideal new world in record time.\nBelow is a breakdown of the core essentials for hero cultivation.\n\n# Hero Might\nHero Might is determined by four core attributes:\n**Hero Might = Level + Star Rating + Skills + Gear**\nAllocate resources wisely to enhance these four aspects for maximum might growth.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:06:50.842000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "hero.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452588183970644079/1452588184188752026/hero.png?ex=6a9938aa&is=6a97e72a&hm=622f75f291f5e74592f792137313fa250a4583b70499edc5f242130c6ab48897&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452588256616120410,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**I. Hero Level & Star Rating: The Foundation of Might Growth**\nHeroes of different rarities boast varying base might, with Orange Heroes being the rarest. Rarity Tiers: Orange > Purple > Blue.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:07:08.162000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452588183970644079/1452588256331042909/image.png?ex=6a9938bc&is=6a97e73c&hm=d5aac560799a1793ca7c40d1c2e3d3bea852c6c85952a46a3a6a970fa4a61830&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452588293257695242,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "As your shelter level increases, the hero's level cap will also rise.Hero level not only directly affects the base might value but also amplifies the bonus from skills and gear.\n**Star Rating system** is equally crucial, as it:",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:07:16.898000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452588183970644079/1452588292997644298/image.png?ex=6a9938c4&is=6a97e744&hm=dcc20dbfd6b950d4bb44d23348d885b46ec9164e99b4c5ab531b56b6928aab52&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452589041433182323,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "•Determines a hero's base might;\n•Influences whether hero skills can be unlocked.\nUpgrading hero Star Rating will unlock more potent skill effects and greater growth potential.\n\n**II. Hero Skills: Key Driver of Might Growth**",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:10:15.277000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452588183970644079/1452589041068281916/image.png?ex=6a993977&is=6a97e7f7&hm=0e2eaf4a7d91078d50e7d4d54ae1ad7a9612727f2baa7f43afe33b1f24d15b38&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452589103865397298,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "Additional stat bonuses provided by hero skills are an indispensable part of boosting your overall might.\nFrom the Hero interface, you can:\n•Check the detailed stats and effects of each skill;\n•Spend certain items to upgrade unlocked skills.\nHigher skill levels yield more substantial might gains, making skill enhancement a pivotal way to pull ahead of the competition in the mid-to-late game.\n\n**3. Hero Gear: The Cornerstone of Might Enhancement**\nEach hero has 4 gear slots for equipping different types of gear.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:10:30.162000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452588183970644079/1452589103601418321/image.png?ex=6a993986&is=6a97e806&hm=eb9d7fc04c44011897897ec683f6677cce98b2f6098efbbdfb5fdf85100c6153&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452590315348295733,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "🔹 **Gear Quality Tiers**\nGear quality is indicated by color, ranked from highest to lowest as follows:\nGold ＞ Purple ＞ Blue ＞ Green ＞ Gray\nIn the  [Gear Workshop], you can consume crafting materials to forge higher-quality gear for your heroes.The higher the gear quality, the stronger its base stats and growth potential.\n\n🔹 **Benefits of Gear Upgrading**\n•Upgrading gear unlocks additional bonus stats;\n•High-level, high-quality gear delivers a massive boost to hero might.\nWe recommend prioritizing high-level golden gear for your core heroes to drastically improve their combat performance.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:15:19.002000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1452590351696003155,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**IV. Resource Allocation Tips: Focused Cultivation = Maximum Efficiency**\nWhen resources are scarce, we advise you to:\n•Prioritize developing your main lineup heroes;\n•Channel all EXP and high-quality gear into your core lineup.\nAvoid spreading your resources too thin. This is the only way to maximize your combat advantage in key battles.\n\nMap out a clear growth path for your heroes' levels, star ratings, skills, and gear, and you'll forge a truly unstoppable team.\nDoctors, forge your ultimate roster of heroes,\nand savor the glory and challenges that await you on the battlefield! 💥",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:15:27.668000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": []
        },
