    {
      "thread_id": 1452590514284138547,
      "thread_name": "How to Boost Might Quickly",
      "message_count": 63,
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": 1452590514284138547,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "# Might = Hero Might + Raven Might + Soldier Might + Tech Bonus + Building Bonus",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:16:06.432000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "might.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452590514284138547/1452590514443386960/might.png?ex=6a993ad6&is=6a97e956&hm=0ed393ab67410db63870547a029906ec2c12076ff7aa8882977078600f079aeb&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452590710371913729,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**I. Hero Might: The Most Critical Might Source for New Players**\n\nHeroes are the most cost-effective system for boosting might in the early game.\n•Prioritize developing your main squad.\nConcentrate all resources on a single core lineup.\n•Prioritize upgrading hero levels\nA hero's level determines their base Might and amplifies the benefits from skills and gear.\n•Focus on core DPS heroes first\nAllocate EXP, gear, and skill materials to your main DPS hero with top priority.\n•Star Rating matters more than quantity.\nHigh-star heroes provide drastically significant improvements in stats and skills.\n\n*Tap here to access: \nhttps://discord.com/channels/1417476085179748507/1452588183970644079\nhttps://discord.com/channels/1417476085179748507/1452586519821947001\n\nhttps://discord.com/channels/1417476085179748507/1452587435383980144",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:16:53.183000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452590514284138547/1452590710162456636/image.png?ex=6a993b05&is=6a97e985&hm=9954e656d3934ed55e6724a63f812c91b88de091074d4980d2049150e0dd0a15&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452590829825953823,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**II. Raven Bonus: Steady Growth, Late-Game Powerhouse**\n\nThe Raven provides stable, continuous bonuses to your entire team, yet it's often overlooked by new players in the early game.\nOpen Raven Gear Chests and fuse higher-level Raven Gear to gain additional stats.\nWe recommend upgrading your Raven level by completing daily quests to unlock more Might bonuses.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:17:21.663000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "17663738368068.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452590514284138547/1452590829574033471/17663738368068.png?ex=6a993b21&is=6a97e9a1&hm=3363a6d045f9576830b6911b9cf2686d35d6bfb087065aac904c8d7bbb5b0979&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452590909546954856,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**III. Building Upgrades: The Foundation of Might and Development**\n\nBuildings are prerequisites for all in-game systems, so the upgrade order is crucial.\nPrioritize upgrading the Sanctuary first. It unlocks more features and increases the level cap for all other buildings.\nSubsequently focus on upgrading the Barracks, Research Lab, and other key buildings, as they directly affect your soldier capacity and technology research speed.\n\n*Click here to access: https://discord.com/channels/1417476085179748507/1452584885096284160",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:17:40.670000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452590514284138547/1452590909316403262/image.png?ex=6a993b34&is=6a97e9b4&hm=9f6e7c02953bd295dd967f235c6d80dfa9dcc570bfef97c55409077c5ba16740&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452590971169538140,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**IV. Soldier Training: The Primary Source of Might**\n\nKeep your Training Grounds running continuously. Prioritize training high-level troop types and gradually replace low-level soldiers with stronger ones.",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:17:55.362000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452590514284138547/1452590970876067913/image.png?ex=6a993b43&is=6a97e9c3&hm=6157e1e347aaf6637a3f3d184b40096ebb34b13da08b024b8814dabc50101d85&"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 1452591018926018642,
          "author_id": 1450685468260696228,
          "author_name": "lastasylum",
          "content": "**V. Technology Research: An Underestimated Long-Term Might Boost**\n\nTechnologies provide permanent bonuses and are the key to pulling ahead of other players in the mid to late game.\nPrioritize researching combat and development technologies to enhance ATK, DEF, HP, training speed, construction speed, and other vital attributes.\n\nYou can choose the most suitable way to boost your might based on your available resources in the game, and cultivate an even more powerful team!",
          "created_at": "2025-12-22T09:18:06.748000+00:00",
          "embeds": [],
          "attachments": [
            {
              "filename": "image.png",
              "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1452590514284138547/1452591018674487369/image.png?ex=6a993b4e&is=6a97e9ce&hm=6be34092e2a225161764dd80701ba4787536595284760b647b1e6bee2742797e&"
            }
          ]
        },
