          "author_name": "olima4040",
          "content": "New Alliance Recruiting\nLooking for a relaxed alliance? OnlyChillingppl is the name\n✅ Discord not required \n✅ Friendly, drama-free environment \n✅ Help with events, building, battles, and growth \n✅ New and experienced players welcome \n✅ Leadership opportunities for active, experienced members\nThis alliance is for people who want to enjoy the game, work together, and have fun without excessive pressure or politics. We're not focused on being the biggest or most hardcore alliance—we're focused on teamwork, respect, and helping each other grow.\nIf you're tired of being used, ignored, or kicked from alliances, come build something better with us.\nHave fun. Grow together. Enjoy the game",
