          "id": 1528115048549974149,
          "author_id": 754131916164300892,
          "author_name": "keres1286",
          "content": "The in-game token exchange shops are a scam; they don't deliver the items even after deducting the tokens, and support is doing nothing about it. I'm on server 40, and this has happened to me personally on two occasions with different items, as well as to other players. However, support or customer service doesn't respond; they leave this bot that doesn't resolve anything, and they are stealing from us. If the game is in 'pay-to-win' mode, then at least be honest and take off the mask. These dynamics are becoming increasingly dirty, which is why many servers are dying",
